ODesign — Windows Native Fork
==============================

This repository is a Windows-native fork of OTeam-AI4S/ODesign
(https://github.com/OTeam-AI4S/ODesign), licensed under Apache 2.0.

The following third-party components are vendored or referenced in this fork.
All retain their original licenses; this NOTICE is a record of the inclusions
required by their respective licenses and good practice.


